ZMRIG is a fee-free RandomX miner, a self-hosted Monero pool, a proxy for a
farm of rigs, and the documentation site that ties them together. It is
maintained by @nggkhaiz and released under the GNU General Public License
version 3. The full licence text is in LICENSE; this file records what that
licence requires to be attributed.

Upstream
--------

ZMRIG is a fork of XMRig and keeps XMRig's RandomX engine, its memory
allocator, its configuration format and its command line. The C++ miner in
src/ is XMRig with the developer-donation code removed; the Zig miner in
zmrig/ links the same engine.

